      <li><b>\u201CAyn\u0131 oran ayn\u0131 skoru getirir\u201D do\u011Fru de\u011Fil.</b> 68.829 ma\xE7ta birebir ayn\u0131 kapan\u0131\u015F oran\u0131na sahip 487.363 ma\xE7 \xE7ifti: ayn\u0131 skor %7,6 \xE7\u0131kt\u0131, sadece olas\u0131l\u0131ktan beklenen %7,8. \u201CAyn\u0131 oranl\u0131 \xF6nceki ma\xE7\u0131n skoru\u201D tahmini %7,6 tuttu; \u201Cbu olas\u0131l\u0131kta en s\u0131k skor\u201D ise %14 tuttu. Yani bu y\xF6ntem skor isabetini yar\u0131ya d\xFC\u015F\xFCr\xFCyor.</li>
