  <div class="card"><h2>Renk temas\u0131</h2><div class="themes" id="themes">${ht.map(([i,n,s])=>`<button data-th="${i}" class="${B("theme","gece")===i?"on":""}"><span class="sw">${s.map(r=>`<i style="background:${r}"></i>`).join("")}</span>${n}</button>`).join("")}</div>
    <p class="muted" style="margin:8px 0 0">Hemen uygulan\u0131r. Rulet say\u0131lar\u0131n\u0131n renkleri (k\u0131rm\u0131z\u0131, siyah, ye\u015Fil) de\u011Fi\u015Fmez. Simsiyah tema AMOLED ekranlarda pil tasarrufu sa\u011Flar.</p></div>
